WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two steady tones reach different ears.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Sometimes your brain perceives a rhythm that neither ear received on its own.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
That is a binaural beat. Its existence is fascinating—but it does not prove better concentration.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Researchers test different sounds and tasks, often with mixed results.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
A product sold as “brainwave audio” may use other rhythms entirely.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Before buying, check what is included, what has been measured, and whether a free twelve-minute work routine already helps you start.
